fuzz-*.log

# corpus/ is deliberately NOT ignored (unlike cargo-fuzz's default
# scaffold): the small, hand-picked seed corpus under corpus/ IS committed
# (bn-gux protocol, carried over from crates/mess-log/fuzz — "small seeds
# only"). Anything libFuzzer discovers beyond those committed seeds during a
# local run stays untracked; prune it back to the committed set before
# committing (or just `git status` and `git add` only the files you mean to
# add — never `git add -A` in here).
